# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased]

### Changed
- Migrated from Hyprland to GNOME desktop environment (2025-10-11)
- Updated project scope: from "LLM-guided system build" to "system administration assistant"
- Revised CLAUDE.md to reflect operational system focus rather than initial build orchestration
- Updated README.md with desktop environment evolution narrative
- Removed synthesis/orchestration instructions from CLAUDE.md (project phase complete)

### Added
- System Information Reference section in CLAUDE.md with current hardware/software configuration
- Enhanced "Key Lessons Learned" documenting Hyprland → GNOME migration rationale
- New "Operating Guidelines for Claude Code" section with practical assistance focus

### Removed
- Historical synthesis process instructions (Phase 1-4) from CLAUDE.md
- Build validation checklists and deliverables sections (no longer applicable)
- Kanshi and Hyprland-specific configuration references from documentation
